On Tue, Apr 09, 2002 at 06:51:56PM -0700, David O'Brien wrote:
> I am trying to use a single HP PCI card with both a Symbios 875 and AMD
> PCnet/FAST NIC.  The AS250 is having interrupt problem with this card.
> 
> Anyone have any ideas?  The "dec_2100_a50_intr_map" is probably a bad
> sign.

For whatever reason it uses the device number on the secondary bus
as a slot number.
It should get/use the int pin translated devicenumber of the bridge,
which is 12/inta and 12/intb in your case.
Therefor both chips end with the same wrong int number.
I will take a look into this later.
I'm into that PCI-PCI stuff anyway...

