The MOUSE_PROTO_JOGDIAL definition was forgotten about in the original
MFC of some extra mouse support.  ru caught the problem and added it to
sys/alpha/include/Attic/mouse.h  ( 1.16.2.2) 2 days ago.

If you want to have everything pristeen, update your sources & rebuild
world.  If not, I'm sure your definition should be fine..

